  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組新增了 Tropicraft、Tropicraft Delight、Croptopia、Ecologics、Fruits Delight、Pineapple Delight 與 Jellyfishing 之間的相容性。（歡迎在留言區推薦更多需要相容的模組）</p>\n<p>當使用上述模組的椰子與鳳梨製作 Pi&ntilde;a Colada 時，本模組會特別新增它們之間的相容性。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1343341283380428911/1344714826139828286/all.gif?ex=67c1eac6&is=67c09946&hm=fd887f8a0e1448ce303abffbedd7c6737b1e1a40d28efb3d074e059b2b2237b6&\" alt=\"新配方\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1343341283380428911/1344714826508931122/cpcpcpnuits.png?ex=67c1eac6&is=67c09946&hm=97ada25947c99141d2185cb5ec55af7b0857c00c7e6256c4c9c13f453699c4fd&\" alt=\"相容的椰子\" width=\"498\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1343341283380428911/1344714826735161364/pinepinepapple.png?ex=67c1eac6&is=67c09946&hm=155fb7428f3669b05b00ecb2eef09119bd5f014d0d005f1c7b0b70bbc00d7be9&\" alt=\"相容的鳳梨\" width=\"496\" height=\"236\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1343341283380428911/1344714826965979237/newz.png?ex=67c1eac6&is=67c09946&hm=79adfa8847e21bb64a2b7adf0b104503c21ca06060e1c245d93717893fe0773b&\" alt=\"新增相容的鳳梨\" width=\"144\" height=\"72\"></p>",
